  "contentHtml": "<p>대학에서 학생을 선발하는 &#39;학업역량&#39;을 요구합니다.</p><p><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/AM6/342\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/AM6/342</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"(대입성공전략) 전공 적합성 --＞ 학업역량 평가\" data-og-description=\"대학들이 학생선발시'전공 적합성 평가'에서 '학업탐구역량 평가'를 한다고 합니다.&#160;&#160;아래는 서울 소재 5개 대학의 '학업능력'의 평가 항목입니다.&#160;-----------------------------------------------------------\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/AM6/342\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=AM6&amp;datanum=342\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/zdK1h/hyY1h1MMmE/6AWOOyDQgb6oDRLhorEfV0/img.png?width=140&amp;height=18&amp;face=0_0_140_18,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ft34y/hyY0tIbsmd/PaapviUDfmxgHAMHxzcK40/img.png?width=140&amp;height=55&amp;face=0_0_140_55,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dfsku8/hyYWX5eD0i/Ujs7H3pGdzc64CwBmyxtM1/img.png?width=140&amp;height=129&amp;face=0_0_140_129\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/AM6/342\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/AM6/342\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/zdK1h/hyY1h1MMmE/6AWOOyDQgb6oDRLhorEfV0/img.png?width=140&amp;height=18&amp;face=0_0_140_18,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/ft34y/hyY0tIbsmd/PaapviUDfmxgHAMHxzcK40/img.png?width=140&amp;height=55&amp;face=0_0_140_55,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/dfsku8/hyYWX5eD0i/Ujs7H3pGdzc64CwBmyxtM1/img.png?width=140&amp;height=129&amp;face=0_0_140_129\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">(대입성공전략) 전공 적합성 --＞ 학업역량 평가</p><p class=\"og-desc\">대학들이 학생선발시'전공 적합성 평가'에서 '학업탐구역량 평가'를 한다고 합니다.&#160;&#160;아래는 서울 소재 5개 대학의 '학업능력'의 평가 항목입니다.&#160;-----------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>그런데 고등학교의 3년은</p><p>대학진학이라는 목표를 넘어서</p><p>학생들이 즐겁고, 의미있는 추억의 학창시절입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>의미있는 학창시절을 보내면서도</p><p>대학도 잘가면 좋겠습니다~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>학생과 학부모님들께</p><p>&#39;00고는 보석학교입니다!&#39; 라는 주제로&#160;</p><p>말씀 드렸던 영상을 공유합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/uewWJJCfgXc\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/uewWJJCfgXc</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uewWJJCfgXc\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"700\" data-video-height=\"394\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/D4v48/hyY1htXmMs/loh2kwSeriBrwx4U25MZNK/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/q96ky/hyY1fJFUe2/cW6qzpQJuEx72YEbmztLKK/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"869\" data-video-origin-height=\"489\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uewWJJCfgXc\" width=\"700\" height=\"394\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
